        237.81947500000001,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "reports about a plane that no longer existed: American 11."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.659675,
        444.85384999999997,
        202.01724999999996,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "At 9:21, NEADS received a report from the FAA:"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.659675,
        419.35389999999995,
        288.05370000000016,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "FAA: Military, Boston Center. I just had a report that American 11 is still"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        63.659349999999996,
        408.10349999999994,
        273.62580000000008,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "in the air, and it’s on its way towards—heading towards Washington."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.660699999999991,
        396.85309999999993,
        187.47762499999996,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "NEADS: Okay. American 11 is still in the air?"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.661724999999997,
        385.60269999999991,
        39.686974999999997,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "FAA:Yes."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.66172499999999,
        374.3522999999999,
        171.0889,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "NEADS: On its way towards Washington?"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.662749999999996,
        363.10189999999989,
        288.04447500000003,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "FAA: That was another—it was evidently another aircraft that hit the"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        63.659349999999989,
        351.85149999999987,
        153.94475000000003,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "tower. That’s the latest report we have."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.66172499999999,
        340.60109999999986,
        64.3536,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "NEADS: Okay."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.661724999999997,
        329.35069999999985,
        288.03320000000002,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "FAA: I’m going to try to confirm an ID for you, but I would assume"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        63.660374999999988,
        318.10029999999983,
        276.04890000000034,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "he’s somewhere over, uh, either New Jersey or somewhere further"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        63.660374999999988,
        306.84989999999982,
        24.784500000000008,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "south."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.660699999999991,
        295.59949999999981,
        263.3266000000001,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "NEADS: Okay. So American 11 isn’t the hijack at all then, right?"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.661725000000004,
        284.34909999999979,
        97.814724999999996,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "FAA: No, he is a hijack."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.661725000000004,
        273.09869999999978,
        162.55885000000001,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "NEADS: He—American 11 is a hijack?"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.662750000000003,
        261.84829999999977,
        42.042424999999994,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "FAA: Yes."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.662750000000003,
        250.59789999999978,
        183.81632500000001,
        9.286500000000018
      ],
      "text" : "NEADS: And he’s heading into Washington?"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.663774999999994,
        239.34749999999977,
        171.23740500000002,
        9.4795750000002386
      ],
      "text" : "FAA: Yes. This could be a third aircraft.148"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.660000000000004,
        210.85505000000001,
        300.02365000000009,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "The mention of a “third aircraft” was not a reference to American 77. There"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.662375000000004,
        199.60464999999999,
        312.01614999999998,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "was confusion at that moment in the FAA. Two planes had struck the World"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.662375000000004,
        188.35424999999998,
        312.01307500000007,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "Trade Center, and Boston Center had heard from FAA headquarters in Wash-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.663400000000003,
        177.10384999999997,
        312.04279999999989,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "ington that American 11 was still airborne.We have been unable to identify the"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.663400000000003,
        165.85344999999995,
        167.97187499999998,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "source of this mistaken FAA information."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.660000000000004,
        154.60304999999994,
        300.04312500000015,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "The NEADS technician who took this call from the FAA immediately"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.661349999999999,
        143.35264999999993,
        312.01820000000009,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "passed the word to the mission crew commander, who reported to the"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.661349999999999,
        132.10224999999991,
        113.26865000000001,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "NEADS battle commander:"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.658974999999998,
        109.60247499999991,
        287.99425000000002,
        9.2865000000000038
      ],
      "text" : "Mission Crew Commander, NEADS: Okay, uh, American Airlines is"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        63.658650000000023,
        98.352074999999914,
        275.99867500000011,
        9.2865000000000038
      ],
      "text" : "still airborne. Eleven, the first guy, he’s heading towards Washington."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        63.66070000000002,
        87.101674999999915,
        276.03455000000014,
        9.2865000000000038
      ],
      "text" : "Okay? I think we need to scramble Langley right now. And I’m gonna"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        63.661725000000018,
        75.851274999999916,
        276.03865000000008,
        9.2865000000000038
      ],
      "text" : "take the fighters from Otis, try to chase this guy down if I can find"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        63.661725000000018,
        64.600874999999917,
        29.325954999999993,
        9.476200000000091
      ],
      "text" : "him.149"
    }
  ],
